        This only becomes valid once the WebSocket is in the
        Soup.WebsocketState.CLOSED state. The value will often be in the
        WebsocketCloseCode enumeration, but may also be an application
        defined close code.

        Returns:
            the close code or zero.
        """
    def get_close_data(self) -> _str:
